  3. API Integration

  No .env files exist. API base URL is user-configured at runtime via Settings page, persisted to localStorage key mcas_api_base_url.

  Vite dev proxy: /v1 -> http://localhost:8002 (in vite.config.js)

  API layer architecture:
  main.jsx
  └── Provider tree: Toast -> Session -> Connection -> Api -> Subscription -> App

  SessionProvider (SessionContext.jsx)
  ├── Reads/writes localStorage for base URL
  ├── Creates sessionClient (sessionClient.js) for bootstrap/session endpoints
  ├── Auto-bootstraps on mount: GET /v1/session/bootstrap
  ├── createSession: POST /v1/session (with api_key)
  ├── clearSession: DELETE /v1/session
  └── Exposes: config, session, sessionReady, createSession, clearSession

  ConnectionProvider (ConnectionContext.jsx)
  ├── Uses sessionClient for GET /health
  ├── Merges health state with session auth state
  └── Exposes: connectionStatus, isConnected

  ApiProvider (ApiContext.jsx)
  ├── Creates apiClient (apiClient.js) — generic request/get/post
  ├── Creates telemetryClient — POST /v1/telemetry/frontend-logs
  ├── Chaos mode + fixture state (dev only, localStorage)
  └── Exposes: get, post, request, testConfig, testConnection, chaosMode

