  5. State Management

  Pure React Context — no Redux, Zustand, Jotai, or external state library.

  5 contexts in the provider tree:
  1. ToastContext — notification toasts with auto-dismiss
  2. SessionContext — API config (baseUrl), session state (auth/bootstrap), persistence to localStorage
  3. ConnectionContext — health check state, merged with session auth
  4. ApiContext — API client, telemetry, chaos mode (dev), fixture state (dev)
  5. SubscriptionContext — browser-local "paid/free" tier (localStorage), NOT server-backed

  Auth flow:
  1. User enters base URL + API key on /settings
  2. POST /v1/session creates server-side cookie session
  3. GET /v1/session/bootstrap validates on each app load
  4. ProtectedRoute gates all /app/* routes on valid session
  5. PaidRoute gates on localStorage mcas_local_access_tier === 'paid'

